{"id":"4ed02595a2cb4caa","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-explicit-definability.md","title":"Explicit Definability","display":"df-explicit-definability — Explicit Definability","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-explicit-definability","aliases":["57-df-explicit-definability"],"display":"df-explicit-definability — Explicit Definability","depends_on":["[[57-df-theory]]","[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","[[57-df-formula]]","[[57-df-reduct]]","[[57-df-free-variable]]","[[57-df-universal-closure]]","[[57-df-logical-consequence]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-explicit-definability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-explicit-definability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-explicit-definability — Explicit Definability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9c053a73bd2d84c4\" href=\"?note=9c053a73bd2d84c4\" title=\"57-df-theory\">57-df-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6a64ba5f871237a2\" href=\"?note=6a64ba5f871237a2\" title=\"57-df-reduct\">57-df-reduct</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f2434afaa125d50e\" href=\"?note=f2434afaa125d50e\" title=\"57-df-free-variable\">57-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9f84d5a885cb119f\" href=\"?note=9f84d5a885cb119f\" title=\"57-df-universal-closure\">57-df-universal-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d75d3bc1b6b86e1f\" href=\"?note=d75d3bc1b6b86e1f\" title=\"57-df-logical-consequence\">57-df-logical-consequence</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_0\\subseteq S\">\\(S_0\\subseteq S\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"6a64ba5f871237a2\" href=\"?note=6a64ba5f871237a2\" title=\"57-df-reduct\">57-df-reduct</a> 的相容子签名；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)\\setminus\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S_0)\">\\(P\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S)\\setminus\\mathrm{Rel}_n(S_0)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>固定互异变量列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x=\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle\">\\(\\vec x=\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_n\\rangle\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{free}\">\\(\\mathrm{free}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"f2434afaa125d50e\" href=\"?note=f2434afaa125d50e\" title=\"57-df-free-variable\">57-df-free-variable</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{All}\">\\(\\mathrm{All}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"9f84d5a885cb119f\" href=\"?note=9f84d5a885cb119f\" title=\"57-df-universal-closure\">57-df-universal-closure</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"d75d3bc1b6b86e1f\" href=\"?note=d75d3bc1b6b86e1f\" title=\"57-df-logical-consequence\">57-df-logical-consequence</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_0\">\\(S_0\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\">\\(\\vec x\\)</span> 是本二元接口的显式环境参数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ExplDef}(P,T)\">\\(\\mathrm{ExplDef}(P,T)\\)</span> 是本原子定义的二元谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 的元数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>，子签名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_0\">\\(S_0\\)</span> 与变量列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\">\\(\\vec x\\)</span> 使用上述固定环境。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}explicit\\text{-}definability}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ExplDef}(P,T)\\longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_0}\\\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{free}(\\psi)\\subseteq\\{x_i:1\\le i\\le n\\}\\land\nT\\models\\mathrm{All}(\\vec x,P(x_1,\\ldots,x_n)\\leftrightarrow\\psi)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}explicit\\text{-}definability}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ExplDef}(P,T)\\longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_0}\\\n\\Bigl(\\mathrm{free}(\\psi)\\subseteq\\{x_i:1\\le i\\le n\\}\\land\nT\\models\\mathrm{All}(\\vec x,P(x_1,\\ldots,x_n)\\leftrightarrow\\psi)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>T 的作用、关系元数和允许的自由变量现均出现在正式条件中。对象公式双条件置于语义后承内部，不作为无模型参数的元层真假判断。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"9c053a73bd2d84c4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"76e02a8ebe51f748","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[